<title>UK: Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc sets 10 bln yen 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc sets 10 bln yen 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO INC.</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.36 PCT  MATURITY    29.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.20    PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M   100</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
